fest-v1.0.0.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Skipper-116/axiom/releases/assets/414833781","id":414833781,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSWWLos4Yudx1","name":"axiom_1.0.0_amd64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":16568870,"digest":"sha256:14d816ffb2a393202b7a9440c1f75837d7c84441681bdb3c3cbf83481f91c327","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-05-08T00:16:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T00:16:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Skipper-116/axiom/releases/download/v1.0.0/axiom_1.0.0_amd64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Skipper-116/axiom/tarball/v1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Skipper-116/axiom/zipball/v1.0.0","body":"**The first public release of Axiom** — a precision multi-platform desktop calculator with persistent history.\r\n\r\n## What's in the box\r\n\r\nFour calculator modes share one window:\r\n\r\n- **Basic** — everyday arithmetic with full BODMAS precedence, percentage, sign toggle, and parentheses.\r\n- **Scientific** — trigonometry (degrees / radians toggle), logarithms, powers, factorials, π, and e.\r\n- **Programmer** — 64-bit integer math with bitwise operators (AND, OR, XOR, NOT, MOD, shifts) and live readout across decimal, hex, octal, and binary.\r\n- **Conversion** — length, mass, temperature, area, volume, speed, time, and data, with two-way live conversion.\r\n\r\nPlus:\r\n\r\n- **Persistent history** — every result is saved with its expression, timestamp, mode, and editable notes. Search, filter by mode, recall to any mode with one tap.\r\n- **Light and dark themes** — system-follow or pinned.\r\n- **Keyboard-first** — every operator and digit is bound; ESC clears, Enter equals.\r\n- **First-run welcome and an interactive tour** — replayable any time from Help.\r\n\r\n## Privacy\r\n\r\nAxiom is local-only. No telemetry, no analytics, no cloud, no accounts, no advertising. Your history stays on your machine. See the [privacy policy](https://github.com/Skipper-116/axiom/blob/main/PRIVACY.md) for details.\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\n| Platform | Command / Asset |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| **Debian / Ubuntu / Pop!_OS / Mint** | `sudo apt install ./axiom_1.0.0_amd64.deb` |\r\n| **Fedora / RHEL / openSUSE** | `sudo rpm -i axiom-1.0.0-1.x86_64.rpm` |\r\n| **Any Linux (portable)** | `chmod +x axiom-1.0.0-x86_64.AppImage && ./axiom-1.0.0-x86_64.AppImage` |\r\n| **Linux (manual)** | `tar -xzf axiom-linux-x64-1.0.0.tar.gz && ./scripts/install.sh` |\r\n| **Windows** | Extract `axiom-windows-x64-v1.0.0.zip` and run `calc.exe` |\r\n| **macOS** | DMG ships shortly — see the website for status |\r\n\r\nStore distribution (Flathub / winget / Homebrew Cask) is in flight; the asset downloads above work today.\r\n\r\n## Website\r\n\r\n[skipper-116.github.io/axiom](https://skipper-116.github.io/axiom)\r\n\r\n## What's next\r\n\r\n- v1.0.x — store-channel rollouts (Flathub, winget, Homebrew Cask) and the macOS DMG\r\n- v1.1 — polish, bug fixes, accessibility passes\r\n- Roadmap is on the [issues](https://github.com/Skipper-116/axiom/issues) tab\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBuilt in Flutter. Open source under MIT. Made by [Roy Chanunkha](https://chanunkha.com).\r\n"}]